 ('AWG','American Wire Gauge','Conductor-size designation. Material, insulation, terminals and application still govern suitability.','electric_conductors'),
 ('CO','Carbon monoxide','Toxic combustion gas; a combustible-gas detector and a CO instrument serve different purposes.','furnace_safety'),
 ('CSST','Corrugated stainless steel tubing','Fuel-gas distribution tubing; distinguish product type, bonding requirements and appliance connectors.','gas_piping'),
