 ('IC / IC-AT','Recessed-light ratings','Insulation-contact / insulation-contact with air-tight designation. Verify the actual product and installation conditions, not paint color.','electric_devices'),
 ('AHJ','Authority having jurisdiction','The responsible authority for the address, work and code family; county boundaries alone may not identify the permit authority.','APP-H'),
 ('Code / standard / general practice','Different bases for a statement','Adopted legal requirements, referenced technical provisions and customary practice have different authority and scope. Keep the qualifier attached.','APP-H'),
 ('Model edition / effective date','Different dates','A model-code publication year does not establish when a locality applied it. Record adoption, effective date and permit transition separately.','APP-H'),
 ('IBC / IRC','International Building Code / International Residential Code','Different code scopes; establish which applies to the building and work, with local amendments.','APP-H'),
 ('IECC / IEBC','International Energy Conservation Code / International Existing Building Code','Energy and existing-building provisions have distinct scopes and adoption histories.','APP-H'),
 ('IPC / IMC / IFGC','International Plumbing / Mechanical / Fuel Gas Code','Separate code families; local adoption and amendments may differ.','APP-H'),
